    "detailed_description": "\u30fbThe unknown world that rules the universe<br />\r\nExploring unknown worlds that humans cannot go to leads to joy and a sense of accomplishment.<br />\r\n An overwhelming threat never seen before awaits players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbControls and operations<br />\r\nLeft: Attack<br />\r\nRight: Move<br />\r\nSkill: QWERDF<br />\r\nWeapon Change: 123<br />\r\nspace: guard<br />\r\nPotion: F1~F4<br />\r\n(If you hit the head, a headshot is applied.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbPost-apocalyptic<br />\r\nThis is a story about humans gaining power from light and fighting against void life forms in order to prevent the end of the Earth.<br />\r\nYou start out as a human and explore infected areas on Earth. Furthermore, the story unfolds of gaining transcendent power (awakening), crossing time, and colliding with the void.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbGame type<br />\r\nClearing the game requires aiming ability, kiting, and instantaneous reaction speed. <br />\r\nEndgame is a game where you clear the game by controlling and identifying enemies (skills appropriate for the situation) rather than continuously hunting to become stronger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbDetailed story<br />\r\n In the beginning, before life was born in the universe, light and darkness existed.<br />\r\n The light spread brightly throughout the universe, and a void was created in the dark void that the light could not fill.<br />\r\n The void spread as fast as light, and a major collision occurred between light and void.<br />\r\n The massive energy resulting from the collision created another world in light and void, and spread throughout the universe, creating numerous stars, planets, and life forms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n As endless time passes, about 5 billion years ago, a planet called Earth was about to be created.<br />\r\nIn the beginning, void life forms came to turn the Earth into a void, and to prevent this, light opposed the void.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n New York city and 5-dimensional space in 2030. (Tesseract)<br />\r\n Humans end up in the Tesseract by chance. After learning about what happened in the past, he longs for the power to fight the void...",
    "about_the_game": "\u30fbThe unknown world that rules the universe<br />\r\nExploring unknown worlds that humans cannot go to leads to joy and a sense of accomplishment.<br />\r\n An overwhelming threat never seen before awaits players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbControls and operations<br />\r\nLeft: Attack<br />\r\nRight: Move<br />\r\nSkill: QWERDF<br />\r\nWeapon Change: 123<br />\r\nspace: guard<br />\r\nPotion: F1~F4<br />\r\n(If you hit the head, a headshot is applied.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbPost-apocalyptic<br />\r\nThis is a story about humans gaining power from light and fighting against void life forms in order to prevent the end of the Earth.<br />\r\nYou start out as a human and explore infected areas on Earth. Furthermore, the story unfolds of gaining transcendent power (awakening), crossing time, and colliding with the void.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbGame type<br />\r\nClearing the game requires aiming ability, kiting, and instantaneous reaction speed. <br />\r\nEndgame is a game where you clear the game by controlling and identifying enemies (skills appropriate for the situation) rather than continuously hunting to become stronger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbDetailed story<br />\r\n In the beginning, before life was born in the universe, light and darkness existed.<br />\r\n The light spread brightly throughout the universe, and a void was created in the dark void that the light could not fill.<br />\r\n The void spread as fast as light, and a major collision occurred between light and void.<br />\r\n The massive energy resulting from the collision created another world in light and void, and spread throughout the universe, creating numerous stars, planets, and life forms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n As endless time passes, about 5 billion years ago, a planet called Earth was about to be created.<br />\r\nIn the beginning, void life forms came to turn the Earth into a void, and to prevent this, light opposed the void.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n New York city and 5-dimensional space in 2030. (Tesseract)<br />\r\n Humans end up in the Tesseract by chance. After learning about what happened in the past, he longs for the power to fight the void...",
